flowchart TD
    START([start]) --> orient
    orient[Orient on user intent] --> route
    route{has_open_question?}
    route -->|yes| resolve_thread
    route -->|no| pick_target
    resolve_thread[Use the user's answer] --> proposing
    pick_target[Pick a target] --> detecting
    detecting[Run detection] --> identifying
    identifying[Check the library] --> classify_match
    classify_match{match_strength?}
    classify_match -->|strong| answer
    classify_match -->|likely| proposing_bind
    classify_match -->|weak| awaiting_user_answer
    awaiting_user_answer[Ask user to clarify] --> END([end])
    proposing[Propose new exemplar] --> END
    proposing_bind[Propose bind] --> END
    answer[Answer in plain language] --> END
